# Nothing below is read by `next build`, and every one of them would otherwise be copied into the
# build context and then into a layer. Kept out for a reason stronger than size: the smaller the
# context, the fewer files a future COPY can pick up by accident. `.claude/settings.json` in
# particular describes which edits this repo denies — a fact about the workspace, not the product.
